  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Move sync_pipe files to capture",
  "description": "The routines in sync_pipe_write.c / sync_pipe.h are used by\ncapture/capture_sync. There's currently a small static library,\nlibcapchild.a, which is built and lacks implementations of those\nroutines. All the executables which link with libcapchild also\nmanually add sync_pipe_write.c. Just move it and add it to the\nlibrary. dumpcap continues to be handled specially.\n\nThis also removes the sync_pipe_write objects from the executables\nthat don't need to talk to the capture child, which makes them\nsomewhat smaller in non-Release builds (which don't use LTO.)\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
  "state": "merged",
